raylib master 7ee0b086 (raysan5/raylib#6040), backported onto the 6.0 tree
sola-raylib-sys vendors: when the activity is destroyed while the app is
paused, PollInputEvents kept looping after setting shouldClose, and while
paused ALooper_pollAll waits forever (-1), so main() never returned and the
next launch hung on the old native thread. Drop this file once the vendored
raylib carries the fix.

--- a/src/platforms/rcore_android.c
+++ b/src/platforms/rcore_android.c
@@ -801,6 +801,7 @@ void PollInputEvents(void)
         if (platform.app->destroyRequested != 0)
         {
             CORE.Window.shouldClose = true;
+            break;
         }
     }
 }
